{"skill":{"slug":"slack-workspace","displayName":"Slack"},"version":{"version":"0.1.1","createdAt":1780841176905,"changelog":"Add/fix Setup in 3 Steps GIF table so connection GIFs render correctly.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":18160,"sha256":"f51e556b543b4f001f85514e15306ab0bbe2f3f2236b4340812b3f77feb0ec37","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2673,"sha256":"d089f09d6f3f8c058375c5383d01ed1675fe4aab87ffac9f6c17e1d56bd54882","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789545030664,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"0aadb17b20acfa60ed40655265528144f50fbd8550a7bc79067e7422c53b8ca3","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/0aadb17b20acfa60ed40655265528144f50fbd8550a7bc79067e7422c53b8ca3","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780845111542},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":8,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789545030664},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This Slack skill is not clearly malicious, but it asks users to install and trust an external plugin and hosted OAuth intermediary with broad Slack read, write, file, and admin capabilities.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Using Slack and ClawLink network services is disclosed and purpose-aligned, but routing reusable Slack OAuth credentials and API traffic through a hosted intermediary expands the trust boundary without detailed scope, retention, revocation, or control documentation in the artifact.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The install flow tells the agent to install clawhub:clawlink-plugin, allowlist it, and restart the OpenClaw gateway, but the reviewed artifact does not include the plugin source, manifest, pinned version, or integrity verification.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill requires confirmation for writes and destructive actions, but treats read operations as safe even when they can expose messages, files, user emails, presence, and audit data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill does not create hidden persistence, but the setup changes OpenClaw configuration to allow a plugin and restarts the gateway, making the integration persist beyond a single chat until removed.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The broad Slack tool catalog mostly matches the stated workspace-management purpose, but it includes sensitive reads, file download/public URL creation, audit logs, invitations, and user-group administration without a narrow default scope.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review the ClawLink plugin publisher, requested Slack OAuth scopes, and revocation process before installing. Prefer a least-privilege Slack connection, avoid connecting highly sensitive workspaces unless you trust ClawLink as a credential intermediary, and confirm how to remove the plugin and revoke Slack access if no longer needed.","findings":"[E1] expected: The Slack and ClawLink URLs are disclosed resources for a Slack integration; the artifact does not show covert exfiltration, so this finding is downgraded to expected external integration behavior.\n[T08] unexpected: The external plugin installation is purpose-related, but it is unpinned and unaudited in this artifact while being allowlisted and activated, so the supply-chain concern remains material.\n[T05] unexpected: The ClawLink OAuth intermediary is disclosed, but the artifact asks users to rely on hosted credential storage and proxying without enough detail about scopes, retention, tenant isolation, or revocation.\n[T05] unexpected: The broad Slack capabilities are partly aligned with the skill purpose, but sensitive reads and administrative actions are bundled into one integration with limited user-control guidance for reads.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789545030664}}}}}